    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Construction Playbook is best practice guidance on how the public sector should source and contract for public works projects and programmes. It focuses on how to get projects and programmes right from the start.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Construction Playbook",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There are three other Commercial Playbooks that should be referred to when your procurement fits within their scope:",
